  "title": {
   "en": "Yamada no Gakkyuu Nisshi"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "山田の学級日誌"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Yamada, a super serious girl, is the only female student in a previously all-males school. Not minding that she is called \"boring,\" and \"overly-serious,\" by those around her, she spends her days working hard to get a scholarship, for which she'll do anything. \n\nOne day, she is told by her homeroom teacher that if she can get a truant classmate named Murata to go to school, he'll give her good marks and Yamada reluctantly agrees. When she heads to the game center Murata's at, standing before her is a frivolous boy who's surrounded by girls?!"
  },
